---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Free GEO Checklist"
  description="Download the free 20-point Generative Engine Optimization checklist. Make your website visible to ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, and Copilot."
>
  <section class="pt-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-8 text-center">
        <span class="mb-4 inline-block rounded-full bg-brand-600/10 px-4 py-1 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-400">
          Free Download
        </span>
        <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-5xl">
          The 20-Point GEO Checklist
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-dark-400">
          Every action item you need to make your website visible to AI search engines. No fluff, no theory — just the checklist.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-dark-800 bg-dark-900 p-8">
        <h2 class="mb-6 text-xl font-bold text-white">What's Inside</h2>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-400">Technical Setup</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-dark-300">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> llms.txt file created and accessible</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> robots.txt allows GPTBot, Claude-Web, PerplexityBot</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> HTTPS enforced across all pages</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Page load under 2 seconds (LCP)</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Mobile-responsive design</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-400">Structured Data</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-dark-300">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Organization schema implemented</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> ProfessionalService schema with service types</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> FAQPage schema on relevant pages</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> BreadcrumbList schema for navigation</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> WebSite schema with SearchAction</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-400">Content Optimization</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-dark-300">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Homepage clearly states what you do</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Service pages answer specific questions</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Blog content structured for citation (H2/H3, lists, data)</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> About page includes founding date and key facts</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Contact information consistent across pages</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-400">Authority Signals</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-dark-300">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Backlinks from industry-relevant sites</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Social profiles linked (LinkedIn, Twitter)</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Press mentions or media appearances</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Client testimonials with real names</li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-400">☐</span> Case studies with quantified results</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl border border-brand-500/30 bg-dark-900 p-8 text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Want Us to Do This For You?</h2>
        <p class="mb-6 text-dark-400">
          Skip the checklist. Get a full GEO audit with every item scored and prioritized.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
          <a
            href="/lead-engine"
            class="rounded-lg bg-brand-600 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-brand-500"
          >
            Run Free Audit →
          </a>
          <a
            href="/pricing"
            class="rounded-lg border border-dark-700 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:border-brand-500 hover:text-brand-400"
          >
            View Pricing
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
